     <td><para unique="1046726">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046728">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1046732">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+210561"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046734">Compare packed signed doubleword integer values in ymm3/m256/m32bcst and ymm2 using bits 2:0 of imm8 as a comparison predicate with writemask k2 and leave the result in mask register k1.</para>
